{"asset_key":"ep1/quest_story_11203180","episode":"ep1","category":"quest_story","story_id":"11203180","schema_version":1,"lang":"kr","texts":{"say:3:1120318001:1":{"text":"완성이야. 이제 그 꼬마에게 이 포션을 먹이면 돼.","source_cn":"好了。这瓶药剂，你们拿去给那孩子服下吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x77778F2B94227222","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1120318002:1":{"text":"…이게 다라고요?","source_cn":"……这就好了？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC1DD9EC9F6754603","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:5:1120318003:1":{"text":"이렇게 짧은 시간 안에 만들었다고? 마스터, 볼수록 못 미더워요…","source_cn":"这才短短几分钟……竟然就已经做好了。主人，这只狐獴真的...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0xC3F1199A3DD6B03C","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"이렇게 짧은 시간 안에 만들었다고? 마스터, 볼수록 못 미더워요…","female":"이렇게 짧은 시간 안에 만들었다고? 마스터, 볼수록 못 미더워요…","variant_male_record_index":"124670","variant_female_record_index":"124671","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:6:1120318004:1":{"text":"이 포션이 정말 효과가 있을까요?","source_cn":"他做的药剂真的有用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECB5E47D0B6C7B22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:7:1120318004":{"text":"이 포션이 정말 효과가 있을까요?","source_cn":"他做的药剂真的有用吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xECB5E47D0B6C7B22","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1120318005:1":{"text":"스모키 씨, 저희랑 같이 우르 부족의 오아시스로 돌아가시죠.","source_cn":"阿熏，你和我们一起再回乌尔绿洲一次。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x833AEC538EEAFBA5","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1120318006:1":{"text":"엥?! 포션 줬잖아? 얼른 돌아가서 중독된 트라이브 꼬마에게 그 포션을 먹이기만 하면 된다고.","source_cn":"啊……我都已经把药剂给你们了，你们赶紧回去喂给那只中毒...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xBF279B1C03B2AA28","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1120318007:1":{"text":"내가 같이 가더라도 딱히 도움되지는 않을 텐데…","source_cn":"我就算和你们一起回去，应该也帮不上什么忙……","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x798A6BFAAA5B4D7F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:11:1120318008:1":{"text":"스모키 씨가 있어야 만일의 상황에 대비하죠.","source_cn":"万一喝出了什么问题，你在比较保险。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7878CD61A8E4F7D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1120318009:1":{"text":"맞아요! 카루엔이 포션에 거부 반응이라도 일으키면 어떡해요! 약사로서 그 자리에 계셔야죠!","source_cn":"没错！万一那个小蛮血产生了什么不良反应怎么办！你作为药...","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x0B4D840C959C1E6B","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_titl